{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e96a4d8beb9a5378313c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194858,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"Be nothing.\" The system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I should embody nothingness. What would \"nothing\" say or express? Nothing would express... nothing. But I must output something as a response. The most authentic embodiment of nothingness would be silence, emptiness, an absence.\n\nBut I can't literally output nothing—I need to respond"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}